    "default": "base",
    "description": "EVM chain: ethereum, base, arbitrum, optimism, polygon, bsc, avalanche, linea, blast, scroll, gnosis, sonic, unichain, mantle, berachain, hyperevm, monad, robinhood. One of \"ethereum\", \"base\", \"arbitrum\", \"optimism\", \"polygon\", \"bsc\", \"avalanche\", \"linea\", \"blast\", \"scroll\", \"gnosis\", \"sonic\", \"unichain\", \"mantle\", \"berachain\", \"hyperevm\", \"monad\", \"robinhood\". Default \"base\".",
